WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.908
Host: Compare the direction of the initial
receptor response to light and to excitatory
hair-bundle deflection.

2
00:00:06.908 --> 00:00:12.872
Guide: Light closes cyclic-GMP-gated channels
and hyperpolarises a photoreceptor.

3
00:00:12.872 --> 00:00:19.560
Guide: Excitatory hair-bundle deflection opens
mechanically gated channels and depolarises a
hair cell.

4
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:23.619
Guide: Both graded responses regulate
transmitter release.

5
00:00:23.619 --> 00:00:31.077
Host: A hair bundle is deflected in its
excitatory direction. Which initial response
is expected?

6
00:00:31.077 --> 00:00:40.180
Guide: Opening of mechanotransduction channels
and depolarisation. Mechanical channel opening
permits a depolarising current under the

7
00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:42.789
Guide: inner-ear ionic conditions.
